.*
.* WRKSYSSTS: the machine's CPU, storage and jobs and each storage
.* pool's faults (or, with F11, its transitions) since the display's
.* first look or F10. Size and activity level of a shared pool may be
.* typed over. Captured on the primary (tools/conformance/golden/
.* phase12/perf/wrksyssts-i*.txt).
.* BLOCKED(phase12): the primary's display is a display file on a hand grid this renderer does not make (as WRKACTJOB's); it needs a display file with a command line
:PNLGRP.
:CLASS NAME=NUMCL BASETYPE='CHAR 10'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=POOLCL BASETYPE='ZONED 2 0'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=SIZECL BASETYPE='CHAR 10'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=ACTCL BASETYPE='CHAR 6'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=RATECL BASETYPE='CHAR 6'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=NAMECL BASETYPE='CHAR 10'.
:ECLASS.
:VAR NAME=CPUPCT CLASS=NUMCL.
:VAR NAME=DBCAP CLASS=NUMCL.
:VAR NAME=ELAPSED CLASS=NUMCL.
:VAR NAME=JOBS CLASS=NUMCL.
:VAR NAME=PERMADR CLASS=NUMCL.
:VAR NAME=TEMPADR CLASS=NUMCL.
:VAR NAME=SYSASP CLASS=NUMCL.
:VAR NAME=ASPPCT CLASS=NUMCL.
:VAR NAME=TOTAUX CLASS=NUMCL.
:VAR NAME=CURUNP CLASS=NUMCL.
:VAR NAME=MAXUNP CLASS=NUMCL.
:VAR NAME=MAINSTG CLASS=NUMCL.
:VAR NAME=POOL CLASS=POOLCL.
:VAR NAME=POOLNAME CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=SIZE CLASS=SIZECL.
:VAR NAME=RESV CLASS=SIZECL.
:VAR NAME=MAXACT CLASS=ACTCL.
:VAR NAME=DBF CLASS=RATECL.
:VAR NAME=DBP CLASS=RATECL.
:VAR NAME=NDBF CLASS=RATECL.
:VAR NAME=NDBP CLASS=RATECL.
:VAR NAME=AW CLASS=RATECL.
:VAR NAME=WI CLASS=RATECL.
:VAR NAME=AI CLASS=RATECL.
:VAR NAME=VIEW CLASS=ACTCL VALUE='1'.
:LISTDEF NAME=POOLS VARS='POOL POOLNAME SIZE RESV MAXACT DBF DBP NDBF NDBP AW WI AI'.
:COND NAME=VIEW1 EXPR='&VIEW. EQ "1"'.
:COND NAME=VIEW2 EXPR='&VIEW. EQ "2"'.
:KEYL NAME=SSKEYS HELP='KEYS/SSKEYS'.
:KEYI KEY=ENTER ACTION=ENTER.
:KEYI KEY=HELP ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=PAGEUP ACTION=PAGEUP.
:KEYI KEY=PAGEDOWN ACTION=PAGEDOWN.
:KEYI KEY=F3 ACTION=EXIT.F3=Exit
:KEYI KEY=F4 ACTION='RETURN 4'.F4=Prompt
:KEYI KEY=F5 ACTION='RETURN 5'.F5=Refresh
:KEYI KEY=F9 ACTION=RETRIEVE.F9=Retrieve
:KEYI KEY=F10 ACTION='RETURN 10'.F10=Restart
:KEYI KEY=F11 ACTION='RETURN 11' COND=VIEW1.F11=Transition data
:KEYI KEY=F11 ACTION='RETURN 11' COND=VIEW2.F11=Page fault data
:KEYI KEY=F12 ACTION=CANCEL.F12=Cancel
:KEYI KEY=F24 ACTION=MOREKEYS.F24=More keys
:KEYI KEY=F14 ACTION='CMD WRKACTJOB'.F14=Work with active jobs
:KEYI KEY=F15 ACTION='CMD WRKSHRPOOL'.F15=Work with shared pools
:EKEYL.
:PANEL NAME=WRKSYSSTS KEYL=SSKEYS HELP=WRKSYSSTS ENTER='RETURN 1' TOPSEP=DATETIME.Work with System Status
:DATA DEPTH=6.
:DATACOL WIDTH=42.
:DATAI VAR=CPUPCT USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/CPUPCT'.% CPU used
:DATAI VAR=DBCAP USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/DBCAP'.% DB capability
:DATAI VAR=ELAPSED USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/ELAPSED'.Elapsed time
:DATAI VAR=JOBS USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/JOBS'.Jobs in system
:DATAI VAR=PERMADR USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/PERMADR'.% perm addresses
:DATAI VAR=TEMPADR USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/TEMPADR'.% temp addresses
:DATACOL WIDTH=36.
:DATAGRP GRPSEP=NONE.Auxiliary storage
:DATAI VAR=SYSASP USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/SYSASP'.System ASP
:DATAI VAR=ASPPCT USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/ASPPCT'.% system ASP used
:DATAI VAR=TOTAUX USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/TOTAUX'.Total
:DATAI VAR=CURUNP USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/CURUNP'.Current unprotect used
:DATAI VAR=MAXUNP USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/MAXUNP'.Maximum unprotect
:EDATAGRP.
:EDATA.
:TOPINST.Type changes (if allowed), press Enter.
:LIST DEPTH='*' LISTDEF=POOLS VIEWS=2 MAXHEAD=2.
:LISTCOL VAR=POOL USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/POOL'.System Pool
:LISTCOL VAR=SIZE USAGE=INOUT HELP='FLD/SIZE'.Pool Size M
:LISTCOL VAR=RESV USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/RESV'.Reserved Size M
:LISTCOL VAR=MAXACT USAGE=INOUT HELP='FLD/MAXACT'.Max Active
:LISTGRP COL=DB.-----DB-----
:LISTCOL VAR=DBF USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/DBF'.Fault
:LISTCOL VAR=DBP USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/DBP'.Pages
:ELISTGRP.
:LISTGRP COL=NDB.---Non-DB---
:LISTCOL VAR=NDBF USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/NDBF'.Fault
:LISTCOL VAR=NDBP USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/NDBP'.Pages
:ELISTGRP.
:LISTCOL VAR=AW USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/AW'.Act- Wait
:LISTCOL VAR=WI USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/WI'.Wait- Inel
:LISTCOL VAR=AI USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/AI'.Act- Inel
:LISTVIEW COLS='POOL SIZE RESV MAXACT DB NDB'.
:LISTVIEW COLS='POOL SIZE RESV MAXACT AW WI AI'.
:ELIST.
:CMDLINE SIZE=SHORT.Command
:EPANEL.
:HELP NAME=WRKSYSSTS.Work with System Status - Help
:P.How busy the machine is: the processor, the jobs, the system ASP
and each storage pool's page faults per second since the display first
looked or F10 restarted the measurement. F11 shows how often jobs
moved between active, waiting and ineligible instead. The size and the
activity level of a shared pool may be typed over; Enter changes the
pool.
:EHELP.
.* Item, key and option help.
:HELP NAME='KEYS/SSKEYS'.Function keys
:PARML.
:PT.F3=Exit
:PD.Ends the display and returns to where it was started from.
:PT.F4=Prompt
:PD.Prompts the command on the command line, or the command of the
option typed.
:PT.F5=Refresh
:PD.Shows the display again with the current information.
:PT.F9=Retrieve
:PD.Puts the last command run back on the command line; press it again
for the one before.
:PT.F10=Restart
:PD.Restart.
:PT.F11=Transition data
:PD.Transition data.
:PT.F11=Page fault data
:PD.Page fault data.
:PT.F12=Cancel
:PD.Returns to the previous display without acting on what was typed.
:PT.F24=More keys
:PD.Shows the other function keys of the display.
:PT.F14=Work with active jobs
:PD.Runs WRKACTJOB.
:PT.F15=Work with shared pools
:PD.Runs WRKSHRPOOL.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/CPUPCT'.% CPU used
:P.The % CPU used shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/DBCAP'.% DB capability
:P.The % DB capability shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/ELAPSED'.Elapsed time
:P.The elapsed time shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/JOBS'.Jobs in system
:P.The jobs in system shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/PERMADR'.% perm addresses
:P.The % perm addresses shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/TEMPADR'.% temp addresses
:P.The % temp addresses shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/SYSASP'.System ASP
:P.The system ASP shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/ASPPCT'.% system ASP used
:P.The % system ASP used shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/TOTAUX'.Total
:P.The total shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/CURUNP'.Current unprotect used
:P.The current unprotect used shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/MAXUNP'.Maximum unprotect
:P.The maximum unprotect shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/POOL'.System Pool
:P.The system Pool of each entry in the list.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/SIZE'.Pool Size M
:P.Type the pool Size M for the entry on the line.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/RESV'.Reserved Size M
:P.The reserved Size M of each entry in the list.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/MAXACT'.Max Active
:P.Type the max Active for the entry on the line.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/DBF'.-----DB----- fault
:P.The -----DB----- fault of each entry in the list.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/DBP'.-----DB----- pages
:P.The -----DB----- pages of each entry in the list.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/NDBF'.---Non-DB--- fault
:P.The ---Non-DB--- fault of each entry in the list.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/NDBP'.---Non-DB--- pages
:P.The ---Non-DB--- pages of each entry in the list.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/AW'.Act- Wait
:P.The act- Wait of each entry in the list.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/WI'.Wait- Inel
:P.The wait- Inel of each entry in the list.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/AI'.Act- Inel
:P.The act- Inel of each entry in the list.
:EHELP.
:EPNLGRP.
